    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an action-packed tower defense experience where strategy is key! In this thrilling game, you\u2019ll protect your base from relentless waves of enemies, each with unique strengths and weaknesses. Build and upgrade a variety of towers, each with special abilities like fiery burns, toxic poison, slowing ice, or dual-targeting precision. Plan your defenses carefully on a dynamic grid, ensuring enemies can\u2019t reach your base through cunning paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Towers</strong>: Choose from multiple tower types, including Fire, Poison, Slow, Dual, and DualSlow, each with upgradeable stats and strategic advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemies</strong>: Face waves of enemies with varying speeds, health, and resistances. Watch out for bosses after wave 15!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong>: Place towers wisely to maintain a clear path for enemies while maximizing damage. Sell or upgrade towers to adapt your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Waves</strong>: Survive increasingly difficult waves, with up to 13 unique enemy types and escalating challenges.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an action-packed tower defense experience where strategy is key! In this thrilling game, you\u2019ll protect your base from relentless waves of enemies, each with unique strengths and weaknesses. Build and upgrade a variety of towers, each with special abilities like fiery burns, toxic poison, slowing ice, or dual-targeting precision. Plan your defenses carefully on a dynamic grid, ensuring enemies can\u2019t reach your base through cunning paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Towers</strong>: Choose from multiple tower types, including Fire, Poison, Slow, Dual, and DualSlow, each with upgradeable stats and strategic advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Enemies</strong>: Face waves of enemies with varying speeds, health, and resistances. Watch out for bosses after wave 15!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Gameplay</strong>: Place towers wisely to maintain a clear path for enemies while maximizing damage. Sell or upgrade towers to adapt your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Waves</strong>: Survive increasingly difficult waves, with up to 13 unique enemy types and escalating challenges.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Start with 400 gold to build your defenses. Earn more by defeating enemies and use it to place new towers or upgrade existing ones. After wave 15, enemies that reach the end destroy your towers, raising the stakes. Survive as long as possible.",
